# Multi-agent deploys (critical)

More than one Cursor agent may work on this repo at once. **Do not wipe each other's fixes.**

## Before `gcloud run deploy`

1. **Pull / read the working tree** — deploy from the branch that has the intended scanner fixes (often `cursor/cloud-scanner-refresh-6016` tip). On Cory’s Windows PC that is usually `C:\Users\CoryRoberts\onepersonempire`. Do not deploy from a stale worktree or stripped `main` if scanner pages are missing.
2. **Do not revert or overwrite** uncommitted changes you did not make unless the user explicitly asks.
3. If another agent is mid-deploy, **wait** or tell the user — racing Cloud Run revisions causes flip-flops (good build → overwritten by old build).
4. **Cloud agents:** never `gcloud auth login`. Use `bash scripts/deploy-cloud-run.sh` after Cursor Secrets `GCP_SA_KEY` + `GCP_PROJECT_ID` exist (one-time: `scripts/setup-cursor-deploy-sa.bat` on the PC).

## Agent tournament leaderboard sort (do not regress)

The agents leaderboard must rank by **`totalReturnPct` descending** (highest % return at #1), **never by equity / bankroll**.

Required pieces (must exist in any deploy that touches scanner):

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `lib/scanner-agent-leaderboard.ts` | Client-safe `normalizeAgentLeaderboard()` |
| `lib/scanner-agents.ts` | Normalize on GCS/file load |
| `app/api/scanner/agents/route.ts` | Normalize again + `Cache-Control: no-store` |
| `app/scanner/agents/ScannerAgentsClient.tsx` | Normalize on client after fetch |
| `app/scanner/ScannerPageClient.tsx` | Normalize before system ranking |

**Symptom of regression:** Large-Cap / huge equity agents at top; MidCap Raw Quarterly Top10 Hold (~+13%) buried lower.

**If you add scanner pages:** keep those normalize call sites. Do not remove `lib/scanner-agent-leaderboard.ts`.

